WEBVTT

00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:03.600
We've nearly taken the outer moat.

00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:06.050
So, who attacks next?

00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:12.820
Keep that damned squid out of the 
little lady's way until she gets there!

00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:30.330
The tentacles are almost obliterated.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.130
This is your Honnoji!

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:38.100
It can't be helped... can it?

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:51.740
This is Nobunagun. 
Battleship sunk!

00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:54.300
Nice work, little lady.

00:01:17.790 --> 00:01:20.180
What are you doing? 
Stop it!

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:30.140
All right, all right, all right!!

00:01:32.570 --> 00:01:35.630
You can do it, Cyx! 
Almost there!

00:01:35.960 --> 00:01:37.790
Whu-cha!

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:43.400
Okay! We've shoved 'em all out!

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:44.230
Gaudi!

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:45.540
Right!

00:01:58.170 --> 00:02:00.360
Operation zone is fully sealed.

00:02:02.730 --> 00:02:03.800
You got this.

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:11.120
Abilities of distinguished individuals, 
numerous throughout history,

00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:13.400
have been stored in special E-genes.

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:13.400
<b>E-genes</b>

00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:17.000
The E-gene holders, 
who inherit those genes,

00:02:17.030 --> 00:02:18.860
<b>AU balls</b>

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:22.790
summon the abilities sleeping 
within them via AU balls,

00:02:22.790 --> 00:02:25.980
and embody AU weapons.

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:32.140
The E-gene holders belonging to the 
supranational organization Dogoo

00:02:32.140 --> 00:02:35.120
versus enemies from outer space 
known as Evolutionary Invasion Objects.

00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:38.510
This is the chronicle of their 
fateful battle for humanity!

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:15.970
Gun No. 12:
Operation Stone Forest, Part 2.

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:26.900
Let's make a bet, Jack...

00:04:27.460 --> 00:04:32.080
...on who can kill the most. 
Loser has to do whatever the winner says.

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:38.340
I'm down. Didn't know you 
were such a masochist.

00:04:39.350 --> 00:04:40.470
Keep talkin'.

00:04:40.830 --> 00:04:42.400
You're one to.

00:04:42.860 --> 00:04:46.300
Umm, am I in on that?

00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:48.150
That's settled, then.

00:04:48.150 --> 00:04:49.190
Yep.

00:04:50.130 --> 00:04:51.540
B-But I...

00:04:56.180 --> 00:04:57.390
Bu— Hey!

00:05:11.900 --> 00:05:12.950
I'll get right down to it!

00:05:14.260 --> 00:05:15.960
Princess!

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:17.440
Cyx!

00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:20.350
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:05:20.350 --> 00:05:21.600
Let's go, Cyx!

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:30.780
Hey, how is pairing up fair?!

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:33.840
Ha! The Princess is the only 
one doing the killing.

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:35.080
Cyx.

00:05:36.230 --> 00:05:38.110
I'm gonna do... you know.

00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:40.890
Gotcha.

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:45.070
Geronimo, mode change.

00:05:51.790 --> 00:05:53.660
Ghost Protocol!

00:06:05.560 --> 00:06:07.290
Cyyyyyx!

00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:11.910
Let's go, Princess!

00:06:29.940 --> 00:06:30.820
Stay away!

00:06:40.230 --> 00:06:41.320
Gandhi!

00:06:43.930 --> 00:06:49.270
C'mon, I'll restrain it. 
Kill it while you have the chance.

00:06:49.890 --> 00:06:51.640
O-Okay...

00:07:01.830 --> 00:07:03.580
A-All right...

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:11.110
So one attack isn't enough! Damn! 
Those two do it so easily...

00:07:09.230 --> 00:07:10.320
Hunter! 

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:12.120
Hunter!

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:18.170
It's dead. You're fine.

00:07:22.010 --> 00:07:24.380
C'mon, get up. 
Let's find another one.

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:27.690
Th-There's no way...

00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:32.160
I'm an anatomist in the 
special task force!

00:07:32.990 --> 00:07:35.580
I've never cut anything except 
these guys' corpses.

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:37.630
Hunter...

00:07:37.630 --> 00:07:42.700
Are you really surprised I can't do anything 
when I suddenly get dragged into battle?

00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:47.520
The way Geronimo fights...

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:51.790
It can't be sustained.

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:53.970
And even Jack's knife...

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:58.060
Maintaining its edge this 
whole time is impossible.

00:07:59.980 --> 00:08:01.060
But look...

00:08:03.270 --> 00:08:06.230
There are way more out there 
than two people can handle.

00:08:06.690 --> 00:08:09.120
Cyx and Gaudi are doing their best.

00:08:10.520 --> 00:08:12.170
You gotta fight, too!

00:08:12.400 --> 00:08:17.250
But this—! It doesn't matter how many 
people we have! There are too many of them!

00:08:17.250 --> 00:08:20.750
In the first place, the one who 
planned this operation is insane!

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:23.030
There's no way she can kill that thing.

00:08:23.030 --> 00:08:24.520
Yeah?

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:28.330
So could you take the battleship? 
All by yourself?

00:08:31.540 --> 00:08:33.670
Nobunagun is immobilized.

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:36.650
But wasn't the battleship 
taken down...?

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:40.240
So there was another one?

00:08:40.510 --> 00:08:44.400
None of the data said that! 
Which means...

00:08:44.900 --> 00:08:46.490
We can't send reinforcements?

00:08:46.490 --> 00:08:49.870
No, not when it's using 
Nobunagun as a shield...

00:08:51.820 --> 00:08:52.740
Shit!

00:08:52.740 --> 00:08:54.300
Do your best, little lady!

00:08:56.820 --> 00:08:58.920
I can't move my hands...

00:09:00.170 --> 00:09:01.780
...or my feet, really.

00:09:03.920 --> 00:09:05.100
But...

00:09:05.950 --> 00:09:07.980
...at this angle...

00:09:10.530 --> 00:09:13.500
Commander, we've lost 
the signal from ball 25.

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:16.360
Nobunagun turned off her AU weapon!

00:09:16.940 --> 00:09:19.220
What is she thinking?!

00:09:25.510 --> 00:09:28.200
A squid's weakpoint is...

00:09:31.470 --> 00:09:34.390
...right between the eyes!

00:09:36.940 --> 00:09:37.800
Okay!

00:09:43.860 --> 00:09:45.180
It's armored?!

00:09:45.580 --> 00:09:48.380
It appears to have the same type of 
thick scales as the armored class.

00:09:48.990 --> 00:09:52.150
What is that? It's not a battleship...

00:09:52.370 --> 00:09:56.390
Commander, look at the body of the 
battleship Nobunagun defeated.

00:09:56.940 --> 00:10:01.630
There are hollows in the torso. 
There must have been an egg inside.

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:04.520
That thing was born right there!

00:10:05.710 --> 00:10:07.860
The messenger class is the culprit.

00:10:07.860 --> 00:10:10.760
The battleship incubated 
the egg inside its body

00:10:10.760 --> 00:10:15.880
and had messengers feed it data from 
the ongoing battle with Nobunagun.

00:10:16.140 --> 00:10:19.350
Applying evolutionary pressure 
to win this battle,

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:22.440
it forced adaptations over and over.

00:10:22.440 --> 00:10:25.350
This thing was the resulting new species!

00:10:26.120 --> 00:10:28.330
How could it evolve in such a short time?

00:10:30.910 --> 00:10:33.730
Nobunagun, please stop. 
You're just exhausting yourself!

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:36.100
We'll think of a way to save you!

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:38.980
If I can just... 
If I can just hit...

00:10:48.950 --> 00:10:50.260
Three-Line Volley!

00:10:52.370 --> 00:10:54.570
No matter how hard it is, 
there has to be a gap.

00:10:56.190 --> 00:10:58.910
If I can rob it of its sight and close in...

00:11:03.980 --> 00:11:05.350
Landmines...?

00:11:05.740 --> 00:11:06.710
What is it trying to do?!

00:11:11.410 --> 00:11:12.770
The Munroe effect?!

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:40.210
<b>Battles with Evolutionary 
Invasion Objects Ongoing</b>

00:11:33.550 --> 00:11:40.210
The Evolutionary Invasion Object battles 
along the Pacific coast continue.

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:43.550
Today before dawn, around 3 a.m.,

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:48.310
<b>Battles with Evolutionary 
Invasion Objects Ongoing</b>

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:48.310
a large-scale conflict erupted off 
the coast of Costa Rica in South America.

00:11:48.310 --> 00:11:51.770
<b>Battles with Evolutionary 
Invasion Objects Ongoing</b>

00:11:48.910 --> 00:11:51.770
We'll update with further details 
as they become available.

00:11:59.090 --> 00:12:00.940
It's kinda dead, huh.

00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:04.290
Well, given the circumstances, 
I'm not surprised.

00:12:04.290 --> 00:12:06.850
Half of our class isn't 
showing up, either.

00:12:09.100 --> 00:12:11.690
I hope Suguri feels better soon.

00:12:20.910 --> 00:12:23.780
It won't be so easy. She's traumatized 
by what she saw in Taiwan.

00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:32.280
That girl who used to be in our class, Ogura, 
might be out there fighting somewhere...

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:34.540
I wonder if she's okay.

00:12:35.460 --> 00:12:37.270
The armed forces aren't 
having any effect, right?

00:12:37.600 --> 00:12:41.160
I don't think there's anything humans 
like us can do against them...

00:12:41.450 --> 00:12:42.320
But—!

00:12:45.040 --> 00:12:46.740
Passenger announcement:

00:12:47.320 --> 00:12:51.070
Due to a malfunction of the signal light at 
the station ahead, we will stop here briefly.

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:57.580
<b>Battles with Evolutionary 
Invasion Objects Ongoing</b>

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:55.580
We apologize for the delay 
and appreciate your patience.

00:13:06.020 --> 00:13:07.070
It dodged?!

00:13:09.550 --> 00:13:13.130
They're fast! Is this a new 
species adapted to land?

00:13:14.210 --> 00:13:17.860
Watch out, Gandhi, Hunter! 
It's headed your way!

00:13:22.390 --> 00:13:22.960
Hunter!

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:30.980
It came for me?!

00:13:42.970 --> 00:13:44.160
Why are they...?

00:13:47.600 --> 00:13:48.940
Could it be—?

00:13:53.580 --> 00:13:57.290
Jeez. When are we gonna move?

00:14:04.120 --> 00:14:07.410
Miki, we'll be there soon. Don't cry.

00:14:08.480 --> 00:14:09.980
Shut her up!

00:14:10.390 --> 00:14:12.180
I'm sorry.

00:14:12.180 --> 00:14:15.780
C'mon, don't cry.

00:14:15.780 --> 00:14:17.210
Don't worry!

00:14:19.560 --> 00:14:24.590
Right now, my friend is fighting 
the monsters for us.

00:14:25.690 --> 00:14:27.950
She's super-duper strong!

00:14:30.240 --> 00:14:32.120
We've got the latest from Vancouver.

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:34.240
The Sixth Platoon is requesting support!

00:14:34.240 --> 00:14:36.150
The Third Platoon is having 
a tough time in Tahiti!

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:39.890
Dai Zong is injured! He can't transform 
with Hackenschmidt.

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:42.170
Rasputin is currently in recovery.

00:14:42.660 --> 00:14:45.760
Sydney, Fourth Platoon! 
Van Gogh is injured.

00:14:45.760 --> 00:14:48.820
Mozart and Cesare lost 
their camouflage.

00:14:48.820 --> 00:14:50.530
The gunboat fired!

00:14:52.010 --> 00:14:53.860
We've lost Mozart's signal.

00:14:54.780 --> 00:14:57.010
And how is Costa Rica?

00:14:58.470 --> 00:15:00.070
And Nobunagun?

00:15:00.070 --> 00:15:01.840
We're still not detecting her signal!

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:08.920
Hey, c'mon, Hunter! Help me!

00:15:24.660 --> 00:15:26.100
Is this it?

00:15:29.710 --> 00:15:34.490
Your friend is gonna beat 
the monsters? Really?

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:36.870
Yup. Really.

00:15:37.640 --> 00:15:40.600
She's saved me lotsa times.

00:15:42.340 --> 00:15:46.040
So we're okay. 
We'll definitely be okay.

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:50.210
Let's cheer her on together. 
"You can do it!"

00:15:51.410 --> 00:15:52.240
Yeah!

00:15:54.250 --> 00:15:55.710
You can do it!

00:15:58.540 --> 00:15:59.490
Right.

00:16:01.460 --> 00:16:02.660
You can do it!

00:16:08.710 --> 00:16:11.170
You can do it, Sio.

00:16:13.740 --> 00:16:17.200
<b>To Galileo
 From Nobunagun </b>

00:16:13.740 --> 00:16:17.200
<b>To Galileo, From Gandhi </b>

00:16:13.740 --> 00:16:17.200
<b>To Galiko, From Hunter </b>

00:16:15.210 --> 00:16:16.540
Miss Nobunagun...

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:19.160
Nobunagun's signal, detected!

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:20.930
Bringing back visuals.

00:16:23.400 --> 00:16:24.410
Nobunagun!

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:34.250
Nobunagun, 
release your AU weapon.

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:36.000
You're getting feedback damage.

00:16:36.290 --> 00:16:40.290
But it's too dangerous to power down her 
armaments right in front of that thing.

00:16:40.660 --> 00:16:41.820
Then we'll have her 
come back for now—

00:16:42.270 --> 00:16:46.650
I can't do that! If I give it an opening, 
it'll head for Upala.

00:16:48.640 --> 00:16:51.000
I won't budge until we've 
annihilated the original cells.

00:16:52.660 --> 00:16:53.960
How is Upala doing?

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:58.630
The operation zone is still enclosed in Gaudi's wall. 
Communication through it is impossible.

00:16:58.630 --> 00:17:01.480
I repeat. Communication is impossible. 
Status unknown.

00:17:07.350 --> 00:17:10.130
Seems like you're slowing 
down a bit...

00:17:14.450 --> 00:17:16.250
I'm gonna catch up to you.

00:17:17.620 --> 00:17:20.250
Your knife is practically falling apart!

00:17:20.730 --> 00:17:21.680
What?

00:17:22.450 --> 00:17:24.500
You think you can take 
the rest with that?

00:17:25.330 --> 00:17:27.060
We're in the same boat.

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:43.160
Hunter! I can't hold out much longer! 
Would you please fight?!

00:17:50.490 --> 00:17:55.710
72% Carpenter Sulfide, 
23% Burtonium.

00:17:56.570 --> 00:17:59.470
That means... if I add Juran radicals...

00:18:02.470 --> 00:18:03.960
Got it! This is it!

00:18:07.430 --> 00:18:08.480
Hunter!

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:16.200
Ugh, that's sour! 
What is that?!

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:17.510
Look.

00:18:22.730 --> 00:18:24.410
They're killing each other...

00:18:25.010 --> 00:18:26.880
What did you do to them, Hunter?

00:18:29.060 --> 00:18:31.810
Take a look at this. 
It's one of their eyes.

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:34.880
Their habitat is the ocean.

00:18:35.450 --> 00:18:38.480
So of course, their eyes evolved 
for that environment.

00:18:39.420 --> 00:18:40.370
Sure.

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:46.160
So, the refractive index is different 
for water versus land!

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:50.660
If you go on land with these aquatic eyes, 
you pretty much lose the ability to see!

00:18:51.340 --> 00:18:55.020
They're just attacking anything that moves.

00:18:55.020 --> 00:18:57.980
But if that's the case, 
why don't they ever attack each other?

00:18:58.770 --> 00:19:04.060
They must have some faculty for distinguishing 
friend from foe that doesn't rely on sight.

00:19:04.610 --> 00:19:05.530
Oh...

00:19:06.940 --> 00:19:11.810
This. The pheromones produced by 
this gland are the friendly sign.

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:17.690
The reason they didn't attack me before 
was because I was covered in guts.

00:19:17.690 --> 00:19:20.520
They thought I was an ally.

00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:25.670
So if we create something that'll cancel out 
those pheromones and spray it everywhere...

00:19:26.880 --> 00:19:29.770
That might work! 
Let's call Cyx.

00:19:36.460 --> 00:19:37.520
This'll tie it!

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:51.250
Over there?

00:19:53.550 --> 00:19:56.010
This is... She's...?

00:19:56.780 --> 00:19:58.860
You're saying I should go help her?

00:20:00.400 --> 00:20:01.540
That's right.

00:20:02.510 --> 00:20:05.360
The most important thing 
you can do right now...

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:08.400
...is save her.

00:20:10.880 --> 00:20:12.590
She's such a handful.

00:20:19.960 --> 00:20:21.890
Eat this!

00:20:22.060 --> 00:20:25.090
Damn it! Another jerk 
who's not the Princess!

00:20:29.750 --> 00:20:33.210
Geronimo, you won the bet.

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:34.580
Huh?

00:20:34.940 --> 00:20:37.770
I have somewhere 
I need to be.

00:20:37.770 --> 00:20:40.090
Where? What about us?

00:20:40.510 --> 00:20:41.600
It's okay.

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:46.050
If I had a vision of that place, 
this place is fine.

00:20:48.120 --> 00:20:48.720
What?

00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:53.480
Jack...?

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:01.340
Those two tentacles have 
thick scales, too?

00:21:25.410 --> 00:21:26.860
A bird...?

00:21:28.410 --> 00:21:30.990
Are you okay, Squirt?

00:21:31.680 --> 00:21:33.360
H-How'd you get here?!

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:38.480
Well... flew, I guess.

00:21:41.630 --> 00:21:44.560
I sure didn't think I'd 
end up showing you this.

00:21:49.600 --> 00:21:52.530
Nightingale Mode.

00:23:25.400 --> 00:23:29.020
It's like heads and tails, 
or light and darkness.

00:23:29.370 --> 00:23:33.360
When the world faced a crisis, 
the other me woke up.

00:23:33.360 --> 00:23:36.700
Next time, the last episode! 
Gun No. 13: Nobunagun!

00:23:36.700 --> 00:23:39.760
It can't end yet! I'm still a squirt!
